[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2822.55, "timestamp": "00:47:02", "text": "我的天啊。一切都完美契合。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2825.349, "timestamp": "00:47:05", "text": "我用十字准星瞄准它所在的位置"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2841.109, "timestamp": "00:47:21", "text": "我的蛋蛋。此外，我们不必回应。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2842.79, "timestamp": "00:47:22", "text": "对他们来说。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2846.39, "timestamp": "00:47:26", "text": "我们不回应他们就能获胜。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2848.15, "timestamp": "00:47:28", "text": "如果他们一直说“搞什么鬼”，那就让他们说吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2851.349, "timestamp": "00:47:31", "text": "他们能做什么？请向我们举报。是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2854.55, "timestamp": "00:47:34", "text": "玩游戏。我们太差劲了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2857.27, "timestamp": "00:47:37", "text": "你不能举报我们做得烂。燃烧剂"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2859.27, "timestamp": "00:47:39", "text": "出去。"}]